From 219ad1703f2164acbc558c941e34acf21ad3582a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:30:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 35/57] Later moves, batch 3: 32 moves with new battle systems

U-turn/Volt Switch/Flip Turn switching, Tailwind, Trick Room, Stealth
Rock, Toxic Spikes, Sticky Web, Defog, Dragon Tail/Circle Throw, Feint,
Poltergeist, Fell Stinger, Dragon Ascent, Wring Out/Hard Press/
Punishment, plus 13 moves using existing effects. Knock Off gets its
modern power. Learnsets and tutor data regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
